{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16560","headline":"长相思 · 刘复","name":"长相思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长相思，在桂林，苍梧山远潇湘深。\n秋堂零泪倚金瑟，朱颜摇落随光阴。\n长宵嘹唳鸿命侣，河汉苍苍隔牛女。\n宁知一水不可渡，况复万山修且阻。\n彩丝织绮文双鸳，昔时赠君君可怜。\n何言一去瓶落井，流尘歇灭金炉前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘复","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16560.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16560","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}